{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19125","headline":"庙庭偃松诗 · 刘禹锡","name":"庙庭偃松诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"势轧枝偏根已危，高情一见与扶持。\n忽从顦顇有生意，却爲离披无俗姿。\n影入岩廊行乐处，韵含天籁宿斋时。\n谢公莫道东山去，待取阴成满凤池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}